00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,717
Hey, they almost pulled
one over on us, huh?

264
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:45,800
Yeah, he's right.

265
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:46,730
Besides,

266
00:15:46,813 --> 00:15:48,357
someone with a bounty of 100 million would

267
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:50,397
have had to pull off
some pretty big capers.

268
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:52,157
He looked pretty young, if you ask me.

269
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:53,457
And if that kid's so wanted,

270
00:15:53,540 --> 00:15:56,097
how come we've never seen his
picture in the papers before?

271
00:15:56,180 --> 00:15:57,010
Good point.

272
00:15:57,140 --> 00:16:00,258
I've never heard of any kid
in a Straw Hat, have you?

273
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:03,588
I was pretty scared
there for a moment, huh?

274
00:16:10,460 --> 00:16:11,290
Bellamy!

275
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,480
Excuse me, gentlemen.

276
00:16:44,420 --> 00:16:47,773
Well, speak of the devil, we
were just talking about you.

277
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:50,727
You got something you
want to say to me, kid?

278
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:51,910
I do.

279
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:55,120
Give back Pop's gold,
every bit of it, right now.
